  "description": "Find the length of the longest path between any two nodes in a binary tree.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "1: let maxDiameter = 0\n2: function depth(node) {\n3:   if (!node) return 0\n4:   let left = depth(node.left)\n5:   let right = depth(node.right)\n6:   maxDiameter = Math.max(maxDiameter, left + right)\n7:   return Math.max(left, right) + 1\n8: }\n9: depth(root)",
